// Rule: [T1090] Artex South Korea Finance - Artex Proxy Infrastructure
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1090
// Classification: Hunting query
// Status: Untested implementation sketch
// Primary platform: Microsoft Defender XDR
// Required telemetry: DeviceNetworkEvents
// Purpose: Hunts connections to source-documented proxy and ARTEX infrastructure.
// Logic: Evaluate DeviceNetworkEvents for artex proxy infrastructure using the existing source-derived conditions while preserving projected investigation context.
// A match proves: A result proves that the published query conditions matched in DeviceNetworkEvents; it is an investigative event, not a malicious verdict.
// A match does not prove: successful exploitation, malicious ownership, downstream impact, campaign attribution or complete compromise without corroborating evidence.
// Expected false positives: authorized administration, approved software, testing, or benign artifact collisions.
// Coverage limits: local schema, field population, retention, collection scope, and attacker variation require validation.
// Evidence claims: C001, C002, C003
//
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1090 (Proxy)
// Classification: Hunting query - Untested implementation sketch
// Confidence: Medium; IOC-based and time-bounded
// Primary platform: Microsoft Defender XDR Advanced Hunting
// Required telemetry: Microsoft Defender for Endpoint / DeviceNetworkEvents
let ArtexInfrastructure = dynamic([
    "101.53.80.20", "205.214.59.31", "124.155.252.63",
    "154.201.79.246", "23.248.249.90", "23.158.220.98",
    "103.248.148.84", "203.160.133.172", "209.209.85.38",
    "38.244.50.120"
]);
DeviceNetworkEvents
| where RemoteIP in (ArtexInfrastructure)
| project Timestamp, DeviceName, RemoteIP, RemotePort, Protocol,
          RemoteUrl, InitiatingProcessFileName, InitiatingProcessCommandLine,
          InitiatingProcessSHA1, InitiatingProcessAccountUpn, ReportId
| order by Timestamp desc
